    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build, Manage, and Grow Your Own Gaming Store!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Digital Market Simulator</i>, where you take charge of your own gaming store, sell video games and gaming-related products, and expand your business! Manage your inventory, design your store, and maximize profits as you create the ultimate shopping experience for gamers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Run Your Own Store</strong> \u2013 Sell video games, consoles, and accessories while managing your stock and pricing strategy.<br>\ud83c\udf19 <strong>Day-Night Cycle &amp; Home Life</strong> \u2013 Work during the day, then head home to rest and prepare for the next business day.<br>\ud83d\uded2 <strong>Showcase &amp; Sell Products</strong> \u2013 Display your items on shelves and attract customers.<br>\ud83d\udd28 <strong>Customizable Store Design</strong> \u2013 Paint your store\u2019s floors and walls to create your unique space.<br>\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Ever-Evolving Gameplay</strong> \u2013 A deep and dynamic system that continues to expand with new features and improvements.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to build the ultimate gaming store? Start your journey in <i>Digital Market Simulator</i> today!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Your Store As You Wish</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605520/extras/02310ecfc7f1f90b9e8176ab6f0892ad.poster.avif?t=1745962701\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605520/extras/02310ecfc7f1f90b9e8176ab6f0892ad.webm?t=1745962701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605520/extras/02310ecfc7f1f90b9e8176ab6f0892ad.mp4?t=1745962701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamically Changing Weather</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605520/extras/d9b2c98d7f228d94f3104ed379629aed.poster.avif?t=1745962701\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605520/extras/d9b2c98d7f228d94f3104ed379629aed.webm?t=1745962701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605520/extras/d9b2c98d7f228d94f3104ed379629aed.mp4?t=1745962701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Night-Day Cycle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605520/extras/fe70c27d2e9b18f345b8754da7e42f04.poster.avif?t=1745962701\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605520/extras/fe70c27d2e9b18f345b8754da7e42f04.webm?t=1745962701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605520/extras/fe70c27d2e9b18f345b8754da7e42f04.mp4?t=1745962701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build, Manage, and Grow Your Own Gaming Store!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Digital Market Simulator</i>, where you take charge of your own gaming store, sell video games and gaming-related products, and expand your business! Manage your inventory, design your store, and maximize profits as you create the ultimate shopping experience for gamers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Run Your Own Store</strong> \u2013 Sell video games, consoles, and accessories while managing your stock and pricing strategy.<br>\ud83c\udf19 <strong>Day-Night Cycle &amp; Home Life</strong> \u2013 Work during the day, then head home to rest and prepare for the next business day.<br>\ud83d\uded2 <strong>Showcase &amp; Sell Products</strong> \u2013 Display your items on shelves and attract customers.<br>\ud83d\udd28 <strong>Customizable Store Design</strong> \u2013 Paint your store\u2019s floors and walls to create your unique space.<br>\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Ever-Evolving Gameplay</strong> \u2013 A deep and dynamic system that continues to expand with new features and improvements.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to build the ultimate gaming store? Start your journey in <i>Digital Market Simulator</i> today!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Your Store As You Wish</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605520/extras/02310ecfc7f1f90b9e8176ab6f0892ad.poster.avif?t=1745962701\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605520/extras/02310ecfc7f1f90b9e8176ab6f0892ad.webm?t=1745962701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605520/extras/02310ecfc7f1f90b9e8176ab6f0892ad.mp4?t=1745962701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamically Changing Weather</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605520/extras/d9b2c98d7f228d94f3104ed379629aed.poster.avif?t=1745962701\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605520/extras/d9b2c98d7f228d94f3104ed379629aed.webm?t=1745962701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605520/extras/d9b2c98d7f228d94f3104ed379629aed.mp4?t=1745962701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Night-Day Cycle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605520/extras/fe70c27d2e9b18f345b8754da7e42f04.poster.avif?t=1745962701\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605520/extras/fe70c27d2e9b18f345b8754da7e42f04.webm?t=1745962701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605520/extras/fe70c27d2e9b18f345b8754da7e42f04.mp4?t=1745962701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
